# Normalize every text file to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this a Windows checkout converts to CRLF: a fresh clone of this repo
# produced a README 107 bytes larger than the source, one byte per line. The
# golden-file tests in internal/report/testdata compare rendered output byte for
# byte, so that difference makes them pass on Linux and fail on Windows, with a
# diff that looks identical on screen.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Test fixtures and golden files are compared exactly. Pin them explicitly so a
# future attribute change cannot reach them.
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf

# Go tooling expects LF.
*.go   text eol=lf
*.mod  text eol=lf
*.sum  text eol=lf

# Never transform these.
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
*.zip binary
